#: src/configuring-languages.md:185
msgid ""
"When configuring language server options in Zed, it's important to use "
"nested objects rather than dot-delimited strings. This is particularly "
"relevant when working with more complex configurations. Let's look at a real-"
"world example using the TypeScript language server:"
