#: src/configuring-languages.md:447
msgid "Using Language Server Features"
msgstr ""

#: src/configuring-languages.md:449
msgid "Semantic Tokens"
msgstr ""

#: src/configuring-languages.md:451
msgid ""
"Semantic tokens provide richer syntax highlighting by using type and scope "
"information from language servers. Enable them with the `semantic_tokens` "
"setting:"
msgstr ""

#: src/configuring-languages.md:454
msgid "\"semantic_tokens\""
msgstr ""

#: src/configuring-languages.md:454
msgid "\"combined\""
msgstr ""

#: src/configuring-languages.md:457
msgid "`\"off\"` — Tree-sitter highlighting only (default)"
msgstr ""

#: src/configuring-languages.md:458
msgid "`\"combined\"` — LSP semantic tokens overlaid on tree-sitter"
msgstr ""

#: src/configuring-languages.md:459
msgid "`\"full\"` — LSP semantic tokens replace tree-sitter entirely"
msgstr ""

#: src/configuring-languages.md:461
msgid ""
"You can customize token colors and styles through `global_lsp_settings."
"semantic_token_rules` in your settings."
msgstr ""

#: src/configuring-languages.md:463
